$C4AE b L7Header ; The level header: restart point, checkpoints and the pointers the game reads
> Restart column $00, restart wave $0000; checkpoint columns $00, $2D, $FF with wave entries $E86A, $E9DC, $ED01; objects $D150, map $E6F8, kinds $F153, movers $F4B1 and $F4CF.
$C4AF L7RestartWave ; the wave entry a life restarts at (the game keeps its live copy here)
